# Front office / store (Ballons_Tunisie_Store) — copy to ".env.local" if needed.
#
# URL of the API, WITHOUT trailing slash and WITHOUT "/api".
#   Local development: leave EMPTY (Vite dev server, port 5174, proxies /api to http://localhost:3000).
#   Docker compose:    leave EMPTY (nginx on port 8080 proxies /api to the "api" service).
#   Production on a separate domain: https://api.example.com
#                      (this origin must be listed in the API's FRONTEND_URL).
# Baked in at build time: rebuild after changing it. Every VITE_* variable is public.
VITE_API_URL=
